# Pinned upstream versions and the sha256 of each source tarball.
# Fill every *_SHA256 in the lab on the first build (build-tool.sh refuses an
# empty hash), commit the file, and treat any change as a reviewed event.
# Licences are recorded in ../tools.json; GPL tools are shipped with this
# recipe plus the pinned source URL below as the written source reference.
